--- task
id: t34
dataset: section8
kind: write whose targets come from a traversal

--- intent
Close a company: delete the employment links of everyone who works at the company with slug `$slug`.

--- params
{"slug": "acme"}

--- edition2
query close_company($slug: String) {
  delete WorksAt where @dst = $slug
}

--- edition3
query close_company($slug: String) {
  $c: Company { slug: $slug }
  $p $k:worksAt $c
  delete $k
}

--- edition3
query close_company($slug: String) {
  $x: WorksAt  $x.@dst = $slug
  delete $x
}

--- check
query check() {
  match { $p: Person  $p worksAt $c }
  return { $p.handle, $c.slug }
}

--- expect unordered
columns: ["p.handle","c.slug"]
["erin","globex"]

--- note
The asset marks this kind 'Not supported' in edition 2, but `delete WorksAt where @dst = $slug` expresses it: the company's key is the edge's destination id.
